This Windows program reimplements Rectangle's window actions and snap areas.
It is not the macOS Rectangle application and does not contain that application's
Swift sources. The layout rules follow HalfSplitFrameCalculation and the
calculation classes in https://github.com/rxhanson/Rectangle

